{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12222020","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12222020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1222202001:1":{"text":"ごめんなさい、ここは私が先に場所取りしてたの。釣りならほかの場所でしてちょうだい。","source_cn":"抱歉，这里的位置被我先占了，想钓鱼的话去其他地方吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC7BE3979BA8991B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1222202001":{"text":"ごめんなさい、ここは私が先に場所取りしてたの。釣りならほかの場所でしてちょうだい。","source_cn":"抱歉，这里的位置被我先占了，想钓鱼的话去其他地方吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC7BE3979BA8991B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222202002:1":{"text":"残念ながら……一匹も釣れてないわ。","source_cn":"真遗憾——一条也没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43A85739C3FE3CF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222202004:1":{"text":"はぁ、学会はどうして私みたいな釣り初心者を魚類研究者の助手にしたのかしら……","source_cn":"唉，真是想不通，学会干嘛要派我这个钓鱼新手来当鱼类专家...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x086E74966C3D433E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222202005:1":{"text":"え？初心者なんですか？","source_cn":"咦？你没钓过鱼吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97FF366F6DE43F5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222202006:1":{"text":"まったくの初心者よ！私は元々遺跡調査員だったんだけど、うっかり転んで足を怪我したせいで長距離を歩けなくなっちゃったから、学会が専門家の臨時助手のポジションをくれたの。","source_cn":"完全没有！我本来是遗迹考察员，但不小心摔伤了腿，不能远...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6249953113BD2688","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222202007:1":{"text":"最初は簡単な実験を手伝うだけのはずだったんだけど……専門家から急に釣りに行ってこいって言われて、欲しい魚が書かれたながーいリストまで渡されたの……釣りなんてできないのに！","source_cn":"本来只是帮他进行一些简单实验……可是他最近突然让我来钓...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x793C646EEC16C656","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222202008:1":{"text":"そういえば、あなたたちは釣りができるのね！？よければ教えてくれない？","source_cn":"说起来，你们应该会钓鱼吧！可不可以教教我，给我示范一下？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1E8A002478D4538","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222202009:1":{"text":"本当に助けが必要なの！お願い！！","source_cn":"我真的非常非常需要你们的帮助！拜托啦！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59643E0235261B98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"魚は釣れた？","source_cn":"你钓到鱼了吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x042E2581430FEC59","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"魚は釣れた？","female":"魚は釣れたか？","variant_male_record_index":"66874","variant_female_record_index":"66875","document_title":"","docum